.TH GRANDJURY 1 "2026-11-27" "grandjury 0.1.0" "Spectacle Line Manual"
.SH NAME
grandjury \- multi-model discrete jury poll aggregator, spend counter, and wave consensus reader
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgrandjury\fR [\fB-h\fR | \fB--help\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR \fIARGS\fR ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBgrandjury\fR aggregates recorded juror responses to finite-choice questions across model families. It enforces duplicate-juror and spoiled-ballot rules, converts sub-0.5 confidence guesses into explicit abstentions, renders exact rational vote tallies and stadium bars, computes base-10 decimal API spend, and prints nineteen multi-poll and multi-wave agreement, consensus, dissent, and swing readings across twenty-two commands.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBtally <poll.json>\fR
Print total, valid, spoiled, and abstained counts plus exact answer vote shares.
.TP
\fBstadium <poll.json>\fR
Render ASCII vote bars followed by the wall of juror reasons.
.TP
\fBcost <poll.json> <prices.json>\fR
Compute exact base-10 decimal response spend by model and overall.
.TP
\fBagreement <poll.json> [<poll2.json> ...]\fR
Measure within-model juror agreement across one or more poll files.
.TP
\fBcompare <first_dir> <second_dir>\fR
Compare plurality stability (held, moved, not counted) across two poll waves.
.TP
\fBcensus | ledger | dissent | swing | minority | bench | pool | aggregate | canvass | roll | muster | margin | accord | standing | answers | pairs | shares <label> <dir> ...\fR
Run the seventeen multi-wave campaign consensus, dissent, turnout, margin, and share readings.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
\fB0\fR
Valid poll or wave set loaded and reading printed cleanly.
.TP
\fB1\fR
Malformed poll, non-UTF-8 file, malformed price table, or set constraint refused with defect lines on stdout, cost precision overflow, or closed stdout write when 8192 or more bytes sit buffered.
.TP
\fB2\fR
Missing or odd <label> <dir> pairs, unrecognized option, or unknown subcommand on stderr.
.TP
\fB120\fR
Failed stderr stream write, or closed stdout write when 4096 or fewer bytes sit buffered.
.SH EXAMPLES
Tally a recorded poll
.nf
.RS 4
grandjury tally examples/recorded_poll.json
.RE
.fi
.PP
Compute exact per-model poll cost
.nf
.RS 4
grandjury cost examples/recorded_poll.json examples/prices.json
.RE
.fi
.PP
Compare two poll waves
.nf
.RS 4
grandjury compare examples/pilot examples/wave
.RE
.fi
